Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.63,0:02:35.89,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs72\fscx94\c&H000000&\pos(529.91,1017.69)\b1}Between Meiji Jingumae Station and Shibuya Station
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds weak, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I trained so\Ndiligently ever since I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be able to\Nfight without my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a waste of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being able to overwhelm\Nyou like this proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pull out of this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're interrupting my sister,\Nand she's not finished talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always told myself that a sorcerer's\Ntrue value wasn't their technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:03:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But eventually, I hit my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't keep improving\Nmy physical abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and enhancing myself with\Ncursed energy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had lost heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided to embrace and\Nmaster my own technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when I came into full\Nbloom as a grade one sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to kill some\Ntime chatting for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be bad again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wee Wee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you suppose one measures the\Nweight and value of a single life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all depends how valuable\Nthat life is to you, big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you and you? I think... u-uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't immediately\Ndescribe the scale you use to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,measure the lives you hunt\Ndown That's the reason why you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lost and just so you know what\Ni think about it I measure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives by their service\Npotential that's what matters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come only the veil that was\Nkeeping sorcerers out got lifted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all should have lifted since we\Njust broke three of these with Eno.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx24\fscy80\pos(-71,112.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1870 880 1870 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx75\fscy80\pos(-106.52,112.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 2080 880 2080 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx75\fscy80\pos(-106.52,230.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1669 880 1669 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs74\c&H000000&\pos(154,903)\b1}22:04
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs70\fscx96\c&H000000&\pos(427,902)\b1}Shuto Expressway Route 3, Shibuya Line
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.52,0:04:52.65,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs70\fscx99\c&H000000&\pos(427,1019)\b1}In Front of Cerulean Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either they used all three to lower\None veil, or two of them were dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, sorcerers can\Nmove freely in Shibuya now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just leaves the veil\Nthat's trapping Gojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the veil that's\Ntrapping ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask this geezer more\Nquestions, but he won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should rejoin Eno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The veil's lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't hurt to keep Satoru Gojo out of\Nplay for a while longer, so go down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and kill as many sorcerers as you find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ransun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think\Nyou're ordering around, Hag?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only channeled the body's\Ninformation, not the soul's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...channeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always made it a point\Nnot to channel the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to prevent accidents\Nlike this ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure exactly why, but\Nmy body has always been special.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's why your\Ngrandson's soul lost to my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soul losing to a body?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill sorcerers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really hit Ijichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like he got attacked\Nwhile on the phone with Nita.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it probably happened after\Nhe left Fushiguro's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobara, go with Akari to Ijichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't use our cell phones in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we won't get anywhere without\Nthe assistant supervisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt that idiot Satoru would ever lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this whole situation\Nis smelling even fishier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.64,0:07:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of things here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old man is completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, once they're\Noutside the Veil, they can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna knock them out! He's a Yuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's our highest priority right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rescuing Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Veil's been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people at the top might\Nhave escaped already anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll take Eno with\Nme and head outside the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you take care of Eno.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree, that's the best course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But operating alone in\NShibuya right now is not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, good. But if you... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I die, you'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have Mechamaru with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, I haven't heard anything\Nfrom him for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as long as you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the veil is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:08:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought of how much I'll get for\Nmaking Satoru Gojo owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes my heart raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was faster than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nita, stop!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.54,0:09:25.13,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx22\fscy80\pos(-54.52,226.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1833 880 1833 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 2,0:09:19.54,0:09:25.13,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx120\fscy80\pos(-439,226.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1710 880 1710 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.54,0:09:25.13,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs77\c&H000000&\pos(142.8,1019)\b1}21:40
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.54,0:09:25.13,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs77\fscx100\c&H000000&\pos(402.4,1019.4)\b1}Shoto Bunkamura Street, Outside the Veil
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a woman in a suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting sick of them all being men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nita, you better go hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, pretend to hide in Bunkamura,\Nthen keep going and slip through Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the way he's talking,\Nhe probably took out Ijichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means we need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kugisaki, don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whispering to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you've got me curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, she's going to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be throwing the match\Nif you're coming at me unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I meet you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most who rely on cursed tools\Nare mid - or long-range fighters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so keep up the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remind me who you are again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting nails is dangerous, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll make it even\Nmore dangerous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she wasn't hiding after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nitta!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shoots!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword he dropped earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hairpin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nita!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you really are\Ndangerous, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, did it hit your chin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello? You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.62,0:12:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, you've gotten an awful\Nlot stronger since we last met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even recognize you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But being strong isn't enough\Nto win in this world, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when my technique is involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand my\Nown technique all that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, which of you\Nshould I kill first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.82,0:13:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work, mouth work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buy as much time as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.62,0:13:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, they said something about\Nwanting to seal Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was asking you what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think someone with\Na great talent and love for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soccer would do if they were\Nborn in a world without soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, is the reason\Nreally that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing's fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep having fun,\Nwhat else really matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Leia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't let me commit any.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm full of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch where you step!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
