Dialogue: 6,0:15:27.94,0:15:27.98,Eyecatch,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(990.46,163.75)\fscx745.72\fscy93.22\fs200\blur111.86\1a&H96&}_
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have come to\NShibuya with Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.44,0:15:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really sure you want to approach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, can't you see I'm\Nholding a woman Hanami here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:15:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allies and their locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.02,0:16:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't cut him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number and locations of your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but I would have died\Nwithout my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number of your allies\Nand their locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you weren't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On my way here, I found several\Nof our assistant supervisors dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.10,0:18:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to\Nbe a grade one sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's make our way to Nita.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mei Mei, it's been too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the thing to say after\Nsending an assassin after me, Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Gojo screw up last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless Gojo and Code were in on\Nthis whole commotion together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo could kill every person in this\Ncountry all on his own if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'd be no need or point in setting up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these tricks or getting\Nanyone else involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually held you in higher\Nregard than Gojo, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nihilistic smile of yours\Nwas always quite charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that I'll\Nhave to kill you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And squash such potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genuinely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Code has got to be a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mei Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a shame too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I'd have to go after\Nmy former upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.63,0:19:43.11,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\blur0.64\fnRagnar\fs88\fscx105\pos(960,144)\b1}Special-Grade Disease Curse
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.63,0:19:43.11,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\blur0.64\fnRagnar\fs128\fscx105\pos(960,960)\b1}Smallpox Deity
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I read this wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a special grade\Ndisease curse. Smallpox deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used up my stock of cursed\Nspirits by the end of last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is of good quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe, I want to keep\Nthe humans on the B5 level.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait down this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you succeed here,\NI'll take you on next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion? This\Ncould be troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been trapped. I'm\Ninside a coffin. I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how many years has it been since\Nsomething has threatened my life like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.48,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx20\fscy80\pos(310.48,226.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1840 880 1840 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 2,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.48,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx70\fscy80\pos(230,226.86)\p1}m 677 880 l 1666 880 1666 999 677 999 677 900
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.48,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs77\c&H000000&\pos(483.8,1019)\b1}22:10
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.48,Signs,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an1\blur0.6\fnAribau Grotesk\fs77\c&H000000&\pos(731.4,1018.4)\b1}Inside Shibuya Station
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought there was supposed to be a\Nhuge crowd trapped inside the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying Ichichi is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did all I could to save\Nhim for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget he had once trained\Nto become a sorcerer himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it seems that none of your group\Nhad heard about Gojo's situation yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We entered the building right\Naway as soon as we arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's probably why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still holding out after being sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you two to wait\Nhere for the rescue team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll join Zenin and we'll head down to B5.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grade 1 is the minimum level\Nrequired for the fights ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just wait here.
